    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654040/extras/ce316519d168653c834bb6ae5b78b263.avif?t=1749226855\" width=600 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrian, an elven merchant, has spent years traveling across the land, trading goods to survive. When whispers of war reach his ears, he makes a bold investment\u2014buying up metal to sell for a profit in a distant border city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But fate has other plans.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While resting on the road, Adrian is ambushed by two orc girls from rival clans: Bertha, a fierce green-skinned warrior, and Helen, a fiery red orc with her own motives. He wakes up in a hidden orc camp deep in the forest, locked in a cage\u2026 and chosen for a ritual he never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out, this settlement is home to only orc women. And the ritual? It\u2019s about securing the future of their people\u2014through him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrian must adapt to orc culture, survive their &quot;training,&quot; and figure out how to escape... or maybe embrace his role.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654040/extras/5ae1678edcf483d9b02e21c025f30c31.avif?t=1749226855\" width=600 height=483 /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654040/extras/ce316519d168653c834bb6ae5b78b263.avif?t=1749226855\" width=600 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrian, an elven merchant, has spent years traveling across the land, trading goods to survive. When whispers of war reach his ears, he makes a bold investment\u2014buying up metal to sell for a profit in a distant border city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But fate has other plans.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While resting on the road, Adrian is ambushed by two orc girls from rival clans: Bertha, a fierce green-skinned warrior, and Helen, a fiery red orc with her own motives. He wakes up in a hidden orc camp deep in the forest, locked in a cage\u2026 and chosen for a ritual he never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out, this settlement is home to only orc women. And the ritual? It\u2019s about securing the future of their people\u2014through him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrian must adapt to orc culture, survive their &quot;training,&quot; and figure out how to escape... or maybe embrace his role.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654040/extras/5ae1678edcf483d9b02e21c025f30c31.avif?t=1749226855\" width=600 height=483 /></span></h2>",
